   "commits": [
    "Click sounds, 8 new capes + SkinMC link, auto-updater with restart prompt, Halloween backgrounds",
    "Ship the owner's Azure app ID in auth.json; CI keeps it unless AZURE_CLIENT_ID overrides",
    "Spotify HUD without sign-in: read the Spotify app's window title on Windows",
    "Security pass: encrypted-only secrets, locked windows, friends data validation, malware scan test",
    "Launcher visual overhaul; capes and custom skies on 1.21.11 and 26.x",
    "Friends system and module audit fixes",
    "Sidebar redesign: brand header, icon tiles, glowing active page, account card",
    "Cape library and editor, VexVanilla pinned, simpler sign-in, polished controls",
    "Launcher home revamp and richer Sakura scenes",
    "Launcher backgrounds: rebuilt aurora, nebula, rain, islands and minimal; sharper, 60 fps, grain, vignette, crossfade; readable welcome text",
    "Widget and module polish: keystrokes rebuild, styling for every HUD element, smoother zoom and crosshair, live keybinds",
    "Radial Right Shift menu, Auroras font, player face, hand-over notes",
    "Auroras Client launcher and mod"
   ]
  },
